碌却又和乐的氛围，「只属于自己的理想乡村生活」仍在持续发展中！\r\n洋溢笑容和美味的料理，异世界农业生活第2幕，在此开幕――！\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[简介原文]\r\nかつて病弱な体で孤独に生きた青年・ 火楽は神の恩寵によって異世界に転生した。\r\n森の奥深くに作った小さな農場は、吸血鬼、エルフ、獣人、天使族…\r\n多種多様な仲間たちが集まったことで、\r\n今や「大樹の村」と呼ばれる賑やかな集落へと成長した。\r\n畑を耕し、家畜を育て、仲間と笑い合う平穏な日々。\r\nしかし、訪問者は後を絶たず、村はますます大忙し！\r\n新たな作物、新たな仲間、そして新たな騒動が火楽のスローライフを彩っていく。\r\nのんびりほどほど賑やかに、楽しくドタバタ和やかに、“自分だけの理想の田舎暮らし”は、まだまだ拡大中！\r\n笑顔と美味しいご飯が溢れる、異世界農業ライフ第2幕が、ここに開幕――！","airDate":"2026-04-06","airWeekday":1,"rank":5694,"images":{"common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/cd/71/575057_BCS8O.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100x100/pic/cover/l/cd/71/575057_BCS8O.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/cd/71/575057_BCS8O.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/cd/71/575057_BCS8O.jpg","small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/cd/71/575057_BCS8O.jpg"},"tags":[{"name":"异世界","count":483,"total_cont":0},{"name":"2026年4月","count":400,"total_cont":0},{"name":"后宫","count":383,"total_cont":0},{"name":"日常","count":345,"total_cont":0},{"name":"种田","count":295,"total_cont":0},{"name":"TV","count":268,"total_cont":0},{"name":"轻小说改","count":245,"total_cont":0},{"name":"2026","count":152,"total_cont":0},{"name":"奇幻","count":140,"total_cont":0},{"name":"小说改","count":133,"total_cont":0},{"name":"ZERO-G","count":123,"total_cont":0},{"name":"日本","count":1,"total_cont":0}],"alias":[],"ratingScore":6.4,"votes":5601,"votesCount":[8,3,7,29,198,644,676,140,15,19],"info":"12话 / 2026年4月6日 / 倉谷涼一 / 内藤騎之介「異世界のんびり農家」 / 齊藤佳子"},"lastWatchEpisode":12,"adapterName":"DM84","lastWatchTime":1792172636612,"lastSrc":"/v/6090.html","lastWatchEpisodeName":"1","entryKind":"online","episodePageUrl":"https://dmbus.cc/p/6090-1-1.html","progresses":{"12":{"episode":12,"road":0,"progressMs":789705,"updatedAtMs":1792172636612}}},{"bangumiItem":{"id":28065,"type":2,"name":"Futurama (Season 1)","nameCn":"飞出个未来 第1季","summary":"该剧讲述了 Fry，一位20世纪的年轻人，在30世纪的冒险经历。\r\n　　Phillip Fry是一个纽约市的25岁的比萨饼快递员，他的生活就是每天四处奔波.1999年的12月31日他偶然的被冰冻了起来, 当他醒过来时已是1000年以后，他也有了一个开始新生活的机会. 他到行星快递公司找了一个工作, 那个公司主要业务就是为宇宙的各个角落提供现代化的快递包裹服务. 他的同事包括快递运输船船长 Leela, 一个粗暴但可爱的单眼女外星人，还有一个同样有着人类缺点(他喝酒,抽烟,偷窃...)的机器人 Bender。Fry, Leela, Bender, 有时再加上Amy 和Zoidberg 他们冒着生命危险为宇宙的各个地方快递包裹，有时也为了减税从事一些慈善行动. 每一集都是笑料百出,一部非常不错的搞笑科幻动画。","airDate":"1999-03-28","airWeekday":7,"rank":392,"images":{"common":"https://api.bgm.tv/v0/subjects/28065/image?type=large","grid":"https://api.bgm.tv/v0/subjects/28065/image?type=grid","large":"https://api.bgm.tv/v0/subjects/28065/image?type=large","medium":"https://api.bgm.tv/v0/subjects/28065/image?type=medium","small":"https://api.bgm.tv/v0/subjects/28065/image?type=small"},"tags":[{"name":"欧美","count":108,"total_cont":0},{"name":"科幻","count":86,"total_cont":0},{"name":"美国","count":63,"total_cont":0},{"name":"搞笑","count":58,"total_cont":0},{"name":"1999","count":57,"total_cont":0},{"name":"TV","count":46,"total_cont":0},{"name":"飞出个未来","count":37,"total_cont":0},{"name":"原创","count":34,"total_cont":0},{"name":"动画","count":19,"total_cont":0},{"name":"1999年","count":15,"total_cont":0},{"name":"美漫","count":15,"total_cont":0}],"alias":[],"ratingScore":7.9,"votes":1184,"votesCount":[2,0,2,0,6,23,85,174,66,37],"info":"{{Infobox animanga/TVAnime\r\n|中文名= 飞出个未来 第1季\r\n|别名={\r\n[乃出个未来 第1季]\r\n}\r\n|话数= 13\r\n|放送开始= 1999年3月28日\r\n|放送星期= \r\n|官方网站= http://www.comedycentral.com/shows/futurama/index.jhtml\r\n|在线播放平台= \r\n|播放电视台= Comedy Central\r\n|其他电视台= \r\n|播放结束= 1999年5月18日\r\n|导演= \r\n|音乐= \r\n|其他= \r\n|Copyright= \r\n}}"},"lastWatchEpisode":1,"adapterName":"baimao","lastWatchTime":1792173282351,"lastSrc":"/show/28065.html","lastWatchEpisodeName":"第1集","entryKind":"online","episodePageUrl":"https://www.baimaodm.com/play/28065-0-0.html","progresses":{"1":{"episode":1,"road":0,"progressMs":42543,"updatedAtMs":1792173282351}}}],"itemVersions":{"sorani266794::online":"0001786320327853|local-state:sorani266794::online:watch-state","fcdm266794::online":"0001786331769645|local-state:fcdm266794::online:watch-state","7sefun622206::online":"0001790871476